# Every Step here is mirrored to its own public repository and published to the
# Bitrise StepLib. Verified Steps carry a maintainer SLA -- first response
# within 5 business days -- so reviews must not sit unassigned.
#
# A CODEOWNERS entry naming a team that does not exist, or a user without write
# access, is silently ignored: GitHub assigns nobody and no warning reaches the
# pull request. Prefer a team here once one exists (@testingbot/<team>), since a
# single username stops working the day that person is away.
#
# Note that user-facing issues land on the six mirrors rather than on this
# monorepo, so each mirror wants its own copy of this file.

